Attribution: J. Nathan Matias, Kevin Munger, Marianne Aubin Le Quere and Charles Ebersole (2021),
"The Upworthy Research Archive, a time series of 32,487 experiments in U.S. media",
Scientific Data 8, 195, https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-021-00934-7. Data on the Open Science Framework,
https://osf.io/jd64p/ , published by Cornell University.

The files in this folder are per-test and per-arm aggregates computed by the SQL under
cases/02_experiment_readout/sql/. The raw files are not part of this repository.
The code that produced these files is MIT licensed.
